{"unit_id":"aichixiaojuzi__dsh-model-quick-switch#card-zh","repo":"aichixiaojuzi/dsh-model-quick-switch","commit":"2503604b32548612bf4ae0e385a819e1db8cf8c2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Quick Model Switch 是一款 DSH Web 插件，把输入框工具行的模型入口替换为供应商优先的双栏面板。它读取当前会话的模型目录，左侧展示供应商、收藏和最近切换，右侧显示对应模型；用户可搜索、切换模型与推理档位，并整理顺序、别名、收藏和最近记录。适合经常在多个已配置供应商和模型间切换的用户。面板偏好保存在浏览器 localStorage，模型选择通过 DSH 提供的目录服务完成。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1525-1607","client.js:753-795"]}
{"unit_id":"aichixiaojuzi__dsh-model-quick-switch#card-en","repo":"aichixiaojuzi/dsh-model-quick-switch","commit":"2503604b32548612bf4ae0e385a819e1db8cf8c2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Quick Model Switch replaces the DSH Web composer’s model picker with two panes for providers and their models. Search across providers, switch models, and manage favorites, recents, aliases, and ordering. Preferences are stored in browser localStorage; selection uses DSH’s model-directory service.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1525-1607","client.js:753-795"]}
